==Faroese==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|fo|non|dúkr}}, borrowed from {{der|fo|gml|dôk}}, {{m|gml|dûk}}, from {{der|fo|osx|dōk}}, from {{der|fo|gmw-pro|*dōk||cloth, rag}}, from {{der|fo|gem-pro|*dōkaz||cloth, rag}}, from {{der|fo|ine-pro|*dʰwōg-||cloth}}

Cognate with {{cog|da|dug}}, {{cog|sv|duk}}, {{cog|nn|duk}}, {{cog|nb|duk}}, and {{cog|de|Tuch}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|fo|/ˈtʉuːkʊɹ/}}
* {{rhymes|fo|ʉuːkʊɹ}}

===Noun===
{{fo-noun|m|dúks|dúkar}}

# [[tablecloth]]

